      "topLevelDeclarations": [
        "durable submitted boundary precedes native create; creation does not prove running or complete task",
        "create timeout holds original claim; late receipt reconciles same generation without recreation",
        "restart cannot recover ownership by JSON or create again; wrong mapping cannot query",
        "cancel commits control first; native stop retains reservation and needs separate effect settlement",
        "cancel during unresolved create stops late publication without releasing held outcomes",
        "preparation denial and payload spoof reject before any durable claim or native effect",
        "actual SQLite runtime preserves original complete intent, owned mapping and accountable stop until settlement",
        "actual SQLite restart retains uncertain executor and rejects repeated dispatch",
        "dispatch snapshots complete input before awaiting preparation and rejects forged cross-action receipt",
        "actual SQLite same task/action/generation refs in another owner scope cannot retrieve or control cached worker",
        "execution persists one intent and final consume before native send; duplicate command cannot wake again",
        "execution denial and foreign completion are redacted unknowns retaining exact reservation",
        "execution timeout holds ownership; late final consume denial prevents send and duplicate replay",
        "execution immutable context and scoped claim mismatch reject before durable intent"
      ]
    },
