        "late fence validates every immutable binding and refuses authority/descriptor spoof without hooks",
        "expiry after durable consume denies late request without releasing reservation or renewing intent",
        "revocation after durable consume fences request and retains exact signed execution",
        "control pause and policy drift after consume each refuse a late provider request",
        "current native permission and memory revision are rechecked after consumed intent",
